        'fix' => 'We make the microwave safe, test the door switches, diode, fuse, capacitor and magnetron, and give you the price before we replace anything.'],
    'microwave-sparking' => ['service' => 'microwave-repairs', 'q' => 'Microwave sparking inside: stop and check this', 's' => 'Sparks inside', 'lcd' => 'StOP',
        'lead' => 'Sparks or a burnt smell mean the energy is jumping where it should not. Stop it straight away, even if it still heats.',
