        'checks' => ['Test the plug point with a lamp or a charger.', 'Make sure the vents are not covered and let it cool for an hour.', 'Close the door firmly and try again.'],
        'stop' => 'If it trips the electricity or smells burnt, unplug it and leave it off.',
